            "comprehends": [
             "copies/cw965qx3168#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Stamped, upright in the upper panel. 2 1 1 1 2 5, so 21.11.25. The fourth figure is over-inked into a solid block but keeps the flag and base of the two plain 1s before it; the closing 5 is lightly inked, though its top bar and bowl are both there."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
